    "voice": "arthur",
    "text": "Hi, Leao, it's Mads, from the boat tour. Listen, Ingrid and I want to invite you and Claire to our house for dinner on Friday, at seven. Would you like to come? I'm cooking fish, and Ingrid is making a big salad. After dinner there is a small concert near our house, ten minutes on foot. Would you like to go with us? It's free. And on Sunday, would you like to rent bikes and ride to the beach? Copenhagen is a city of bikes! Send me a message, OK? Talk soon. Bye!"
   },
   {
    "file": "a25_listening2.mp3",
    "voice": "ellen",
    "text": "Good evening, ladies and gentlemen. Our flight to London is two hours and twenty minutes. In a few minutes we will come with dinner. Would you like chicken or pasta tonight? And to drink, we have water, juice, coffee and tea. After dinner, would you like a blanket? Just ask. It can be cold at night. Would you like a newspaper? We have English and Danish newspapers. We land in London at ten thirty. Thank you, and enjoy your flight."
